Course Description:
(Prerequisite: Placement at 300 level on Phase II placement exam, grade of ‘C’ or better in SPAN B202, or consent of instructor. Department consent
required for transfer students.) Intensive language practice in native environment with emphasis on oral skills. Instruction by native speakers;
community contact and home stay. Prior placement test required. May be repeated once for credit.

